Package: r105
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35)
Maintainer: r105 maintainers <maintainers@r105.dev>
Homepage: https://github.com/bnelabs/r105
Description: Native local-first AI harness for OpenAI-compatible backends
 r105 is a Rust terminal AI harness with streaming responses, bounded tools,
 MCP integration, native plugins, sessions, and sandbox-aware execution.
